# The launcher's Resolution arrow, with the kit's full display-mode list (run
# without RECOMP_DDRAW_MODES): 800 x 600 (Original), 1280 x 720 (HD), then
# 1920 x 1080 (FullHD). The launcher offers only the three the game has
# layouts for, and each needs an exact display mode when Fullscreen is ticked.
wait 6000
dump res0
click left 525 377
wait 700
dump res1
click left 525 377
wait 700
dump res2
wait 300
